The XERBLA subroutine as in the reference implementation of BLAS stops the
execution of the calling process.
We do not want that behavior in Octave. To be able to replace that function by
our own implementation in Octave, move the XERBLA subroutine to a separate
library.

diff -urN lapack-3.12.1/CMakeLists.txt.orig lapack-3.12.1/CMakeLists.txt
